            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "Salve, Cardinal Velliv, it's been a while."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1780_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Velliv",
        "text": "Not 'cardinal' anymore. I'm just an ordinary clerk in the Shrine of Nurtury now."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#1$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "Just 'Velliv', then? Anyway, it seems like your fingerprints are all over it."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1780_1#4$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Velliv",
        "text": "What do you mean?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#1$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "The security measures I saw on my way in from the streets. They could go toe-to-toe with the Pontifica Cohors."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1780_1#11$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Velliv",
        "text": "I have to earn my keep, after all."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1780_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Velliv",
        "text": "Anyway, it looks like I guessed right."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#6$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "What?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1780_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Velliv",
        "text": "It was indeed you who came to review our security... even though this is a job usually reserved for Notarial Hall executors, or the gun-knights and Pontifica Cohors."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#1$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "I'm still investigating the bombing that happened a couple of days ago. I'm not exactly an outsider."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1780_1#2$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Velliv",
        "text": "I wasn't instructed to take the bomb investigation into account when planning security. Besides, your investigation hasn't exactly turned up anything concrete, has it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1780_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Velliv",
        "text": "Unless you mean to tell me you came because it was Andoain who was attacked?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#8$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#2$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "Are you going to chide me that I should be thinking of the whole Holy City as a cardinal of the Seventh Tribunal, and not about my personal relationships?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1780_1#3$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Velliv",
        "text": "We know just what kind of person you are."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1780_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Velliv",
        "text": "Sharp, astute, decisive, all traits that served you well at the consistory..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Velliv",
        "text": "But we also know when these virtues of yours are most prominently displayed."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1780_1#8$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Velliv",
        "text": "I remember the reasons why you joined the Pontifica Cohors commandos, Cardinal Lemuen. I read that report."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#1$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "Hah. Do you really? I've forgotten."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1780_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Velliv",
        "text": "You didn't really have any interest in the commandos. You just went to see Fiammetta, didn't you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#2$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "And Andoain."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1780_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Velliv",
        "text": "Really? That I didn't know. I thought you met after you joined the commandos."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#2$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "We met before that."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#8$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "It seemed like he had come from a far away place, walking on foot. His clothes were tattered, and he himself was just as ragged."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "He sat on a bench in front of the chapel, still and unmoving, looking more like a statue than the actual statues of the saints on the roadside."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#2$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "That was the first time Mostima and I saw him."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#1$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "We met Fiammetta at the midnight movies. We hit it off quickly."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "Andoain had trouble fitting in, having grown up outside the Holy City. Fiammetta, stubborn girl that she is, was in another one of those fights with her grandpa... Mostima and I wanted to see them."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "They didn't know each other beforehand, and the other Sanktas probably didn't intend to isolate them, but either way, the end result was\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#2$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "The two of them were the only ones left behind in the rubber-bullet roulette that was the commandos' initiation."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1780_1#2$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Velliv",
        "text": "And so you beat up everyone else on the scene..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Velliv",
        "text": "You and Mostima filled out your applications right there, becoming the last four-man squad at that initiation."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Velliv",
        "text": "You ended up being the most active and most coordinated squad on the force, until the incident..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1780_1#9$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Velliv",
        "text": "There is a lot I admire about you, Lemuen, but I must remind you... as a cardinal, the Holy City must be your first, foremost, and only concern."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#1$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "To me, the Holy City begins with a long list of familiar names."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#2$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "So much for reminiscing."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#8$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "The Seventh Tribunal knows our duty. If you really think of yourself as an ordinary clerk, then maybe I should pay a visit to the Matriarch personally."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_1780_1#9$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Velliv",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#8$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "She's right up ahead, isn't she?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
