    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer",
        "text": "M-Matriarch. Blessings to you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer",
        "text": "The mother's condition has stabilized. We have given her medicine and nutrition. She is sleeping now."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1777_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Matriarch",
        "text": "That is comforting to hear."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Matriarch",
        "text": "She is expecting soon. Please keep a close eye on her, and do not let yourselves grow complacent."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1785_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer",
        "text": "Yes, Matriarch."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
            "volume": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "duration": 1.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1777_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Matriarch",
        "text": "Praise be to the Lord."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#1$2",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "I can feel the relief and joy coming from the bottom of your heart."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1777_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Matriarch",
        "text": "Thank you for your companionship, Cardinal. I hope empathy did not cause my anxiety to affect you."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#9$2",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "I'm not so weak. Besides, your words were inspiring, to an extent."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#1$2",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "You mentioned that you only came here later?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1777_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Matriarch",
        "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Matriarch",
        "text": "Long had I wandered the wilderness, my companions withered in the mud..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#14$2",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "In order to find Laterano?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1777_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Matriarch",
        "text": "No, at the time I never imagined that there would be such a city upon this land."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Matriarch",
        "text": "But our shared vision finally helped me locate it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Matriarch",
        "text": "Our encounter here and now was written in fate."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Matriarch",
        "text": "It is a blessing to be able to serve Laterano and my kindred, after all this time, frail as I may be."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#1$2",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "I have a friend who works here. He also came from afar..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1777_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Matriarch",
        "text": "In Laterano today and Laterano tomorrow, everyone must and will find their own place and play their own roles... only then can we hope to fend off calamity."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#1$2",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "It seems we've gotten sidetracked."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "If there has been an attack on the Nurturers, the Seventh Tribunal is happy to work with the Shrine of Nurtury in implementing security measures, to ensure that the Nativity goes off without a hitch."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1777_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Matriarch",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Matriarch",
        "text": "I understand your worry for your friend, and your curiosity about this shrine."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Matriarch",
        "text": "As I said, though, we must all find our own place and play our own roles."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#2$2",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "And there I was, thinking our chat was going nicely."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#1$2",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "Looks like I've been summarily rejected, haven't I?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
