    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1784_1#3$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "...I'm sorry for your loss."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "I should have brought a few wheat stalks, if I only knew this had happened."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_001",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kuranta",
        "text": "Wheat stalks?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1784_1#3$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "For funerals at the Landen Monastery, we weave a laurel out of wheat stalks and place it upon the departed's coffin."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "That way, the soul of the departed will be comforted by the scent of bread and beer on the other side."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_001",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kuranta",
        "text": "Thank you, kind sister."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kuranta",
        "text": "My brother and I were exiled by the General Chamber of Commerce because we were afflicted with Oripathy, and did not have the skill to participate in knightsports."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kuranta",
        "text": "We came all this way to Laterano, only for his condition to worsen and take his life..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kuranta",
        "text": "But the Curia helped bury him, allowing him to die with dignity... there was even a passing Sankta who played a requiem for him."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1784_1#6$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "I see..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
            "volume": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1",
            "duration": 1.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Federico",
        "text": "Was that Sankta a female with long, straight black hair, playing a cello with an unusual shape?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_001",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kuranta",
        "text": "Er, yes."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Federico",
        "text": "She played for you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Federico",
        "text": "Were you subject to any hallucinations, or any psychological discomfort?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_001",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kuranta",
        "text": "What do mean by discomfort? I know it made me cry. It was my brother, after all..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#4$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Federico",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1784_1#6$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "Senior Executor, I thought we agreed that I would do the questioning..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#4$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Federico",
        "text": "Other executors from Notarial Hall will soon be here to take these refugees to Pagus Ambrosius. We do not have much time."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Federico",
        "text": "They are not suspected of any crime. I did not find complex interrogation techniques to be necessary."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1784_1#3$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "I visited Lungmen and Victoria when I was promoting Landen Monastery, and I saw many people like them."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "They were forced to leave home due to unfortunate circumstances. Their previous dealings with the police have made them..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "Executors are more or less police, right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_001",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kuranta",
        "text": "Uh, there's no need. You guys just took in outsiders with Oripathy like us, even though I heard you used to kick your own Infected out."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kuranta",
        "text": "So, right now, I don't have anything against the Lateran government. Besides, this gentleman here looks like a decent fellow..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1784_1#3$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Federico",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_001",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kuranta",
        "text": "Is there something wrong with the black-haired Sankta you were asking about?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Federico",
        "text": "Without permission, she left the monastery where she was under observation. We have tracked her here."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_001",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kuranta",
        "text": "Sh-She's a prisoner? I thought she was an official from your, what's that, Sixth Tribunal?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#9$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Federico",
        "text": "Why did you think that?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_001",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kuranta",
        "text": "She asked us about the abbey after the funeral, whether there was any equipment in disrepair, any safety hazards, any supplies we were short on."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kuranta",
        "text": "She made it a point to ask if anyone who recently entered Laterano had disappeared, especially any pregnant women..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1784_1#3$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard",
        "text": "(Doesn't sound like Arturia just happened to pass by...)"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#6$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Federico",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
