        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Velliv",
        "text": "How did it go?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#2$2",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "You know the answer."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "The Matriarch's response was just like yours\u2014'don't poke your head into other people's business.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1780_1#8$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Velliv",
        "text": "Hehe."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Velliv",
        "text": "I know you have good intentions, Lemuen, but you're also showing that you don't trust me."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#8$2",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "I beg your understanding."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#6$2",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "The Shrine of Nurtury, this great structure that casts a shadow over Laterano, which no one's quite sure when it came to be..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "You, Reverend Patrizion and the Matriarch promise that this will be the birthplace of the future. Even the suspect behind the bombings seems interested in it."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#1$2",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "How can the Seventh Tribunal, responsible for intelligence and national security, ignore something so prominent?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1780_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Velliv",
        "text": "Of course, I understand."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
