    },
    {
        "text": "The Nurturer leads a group past. Their footsteps echo through the empty hall."
    },
    {
        "text": "The people in the procession come from many different races. None of them speak, but all glance up and down at this unfamiliar space."
    },
    {
        "text": "Lemuen steps aside to let them pass."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
